    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_01",
      "hash64": "38E36967BE56EA7D",
      "text": "Hé ! [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Par ici ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_02",
      "hash64": "38E36667BE56E564",
      "text": "Ça, c’est un Centre Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_03",
      "hash64": "38E36767BE56E717",
      "text": "Tu peux y faire un tas de choses pour\\ntes Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_04",
      "hash64": "38E36467BE56E1FE",
      "text": "Bonjour ! Vous pouvez lui expliquer comment\\nça marche, ici ?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_01",
      "hash64": "AD11B217AFBB942A",
      "text": "Bien entendu !\\nTout d’abord, bienvenue au Centre Pokémon !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_02",
      "hash64": "AD11B117AFBB9277",
      "text": "Notre rôle est de soigner les Pokémon\\nde tous nos visiteurs.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_03",
      "hash64": "AD11B017AFBB90C4",
      "text": "L’appareil que vous voyez ici est ce\\nqu’on appelle une Machine à CT !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_04",
      "hash64": "AD11AF17AFBB8F11",
      "text": "Comme son nom l’indique, elle sert à créer\\ndes CT, ou « Capsules Techniques ».\\c\\nCe sont des objets qui permettent à vos Pokémon\\nd’apprendre de nouvelles capacités.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_05",
      "hash64": "AD11AE17AFBB8D5E",
      "text": "Mais pour l’utiliser, vous aurez besoin de [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]PL[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] et\\nd’[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]échantillons[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] que les Pokémon abandonnent\\r\\nderrière eux en combat.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_10",
      "hash64": "38E6CE67BE59CBF3",
      "text": "Les PL sont super utiles ! Tu peux les utiliser dans\\ndes boutiques ou dans la Machine à CT !\\c\\nTiens, je t’en donne un peu, j’en ai plein ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_11",
      "hash64": "38E6CD67BE59CA40",
      "text": "Et voilà aussi quelques échantillons ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0210_system_01",
      "hash64": "F7614DBDC1C939C0",
      "text": "Menzi vous donne tout un tas d’échantillons !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_06",
      "hash64": "AD11AD17AFBB8BAB",
      "text": "Juste à côté de moi se trouve\\nla Boutique Pokémon.\\c\\nVous pouvez y acheter des Potions ou encore\\ndes Poké Balls pour capturer des Pokémon.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0210_shop_01",
      "hash64": "7B9566714708511F",
      "text": "La boutique accepte aussi les [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Points de Ligue[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\nou [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]PL[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], comme moyen de paiement.\\r\\n1 PL est égal à 1 .",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_07",
      "hash64": "AD11AC17AFBB89F8",
      "text": "Le Club Union vous permet, quant à lui,\\nde vous connecter à d’autres Dresseurs pour\\r\\nrecruter des compagnons d’aventure !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0210_pokecen_08",
      "hash64": "AD11AB17AFBB8845",
      "text": "Bref, si vous avez besoin de quoi que ce soit,\\nles Centres Pokémon sont là pour vous aider !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_05",
      "hash64": "38E36567BE56E3B1",
      "text": "Merci pour ces explications ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_06",
      "hash64": "38E36267BE56DE98",
      "text": "T’as bien compris ? En cas de difficulté,\\nle Centre Pokémon est là pour t’aider !\\c\\nL’oublie pas, c’est un truc qu’on nous demande\\nen interro ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_08",
      "hash64": "38E36067BE56DB32",
      "text": "Et quand tu commenceras à t’habituer à\\ntes Pokémon, oublie pas cette phrase :\\r\\n« [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Bouton R, en avant ![VAR 0xFF00(0000)] »[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_09",
      "hash64": "38E36167BE56DCE5",
      "text": "En gros, en appuyant sur le bouton R, tu peux\\ndemander au Pokémon qui te suit d’aller ramasser\\r\\nles objets tombés au sol, ou bien d’aller se battre.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0210_rival_07",
      "hash64": "38E36367BE56E04B",
      "text": "Maintenant qu’on a vu Plato Real, direction la\\nZone Sud nº 1 et la fameuse colline de l’école !\\c\\nTu vas voir, y a plein de Dresseurs qui veulent\\nse battre là-bas, alors accroche-toi bien ![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
